# Ready for custom IPA audio files (.mp3)
# To use your custom audios:
# 1. Keep existing filenames. Use the stable sound/card ID (e.g., C001.mp3 or V079.mp3).
# 2. Add genuine MP3s here and restart Vite (or rebuild) to refresh availability.
# 3. Record the source, author and licence. See ATTRIBUTION.md for this release.
